{"id":"660085","name":"紫菜虾滑","author":"莉莉呀Lilly","authorId":"12967468","desc":"","cover":"images/660085/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾","amount":"1斤"}],"sub":[{"name":"紫菜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"虾去壳去头去虾线，剥好的肉再用清水清洗干净。","img":"images/660085/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"虾肉切成丁。","img":"images/660085/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"剁肉泥，越碎越好。","img":"images/660085/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放一勺白糖腌制3分钟左右。","img":"images/660085/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再加入一勺盐搅拌均匀腌制5分钟。","img":"images/660085/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"打两个鸡蛋清，蛋黄不要。","img":"images/660085/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入2勺玉米淀粉。","img":"images/660085/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"紫菜剁碎放进去搅拌均匀。","img":"images/660085/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒水烧开。","img":"images/660085/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"用小勺子和筷子一个一个擀下锅。","img":"images/660085/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煮7分钟左右漂浮在表面后起锅。","img":"images/660085/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"装汤碗端出。","img":"images/660085/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}